<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>脈輪 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA/</link><description>Recent content in 脈輪 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>12星座對應脈輪指南：找到你最需要平衡的能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;占星與脈輪，是兩套不同的系統——但它們&lt;strong&gt;互相對應&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>接地、能量淨化、冥想：脈輪日常療癒三大實作技巧</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果說脈輪療癒有一套&lt;strong&gt;最低限度的日常保養 SOP&lt;/strong&gt;，那就是這三件事：&lt;strong&gt;接地（Grounding）、能量淨化（Energy Cleansing）、冥想（Meditation）&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>脈輪失衡的常見徵兆：身心警訊怎麼讀懂能量訊息</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</link><pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;身體比你聰明。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>臍輪完整指南：橘色情感之輪喚醒創造力與感官生命力</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%87%8D%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%A9%98%E8%89%B2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%96%9A%E9%86%92%E5%89%B5%E9%80%A0%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%8A%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%87%8D%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%A9%98%E8%89%B2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%96%9A%E9%86%92%E5%89%B5%E9%80%A0%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%8A%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果說海底輪管「&lt;strong&gt;我是不是安全的&lt;/strong&gt;」，那臍輪管的就是下一個層次的問題：「&lt;strong&gt;我有沒有允許自己感受？我有沒有讓自己活著？&lt;/strong&gt;」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>太陽神經叢完整指南：黃色力量之輪建立自我價值與行動力</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%A5%9E%E7%B6%93%E5%8F%A2%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%BB%83%E8%89%B2%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E5%83%B9%E5%80%BC%E8%88%87%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95%E5%8A%9B/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%A5%9E%E7%B6%93%E5%8F%A2%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%BB%83%E8%89%B2%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E5%83%B9%E5%80%BC%E8%88%87%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95%E5%8A%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「&lt;strong&gt;我不夠好。&lt;/strong&gt;」「&lt;strong&gt;我做不到。&lt;/strong&gt;」「&lt;strong&gt;算了，照他們說的吧。&lt;/strong&gt;」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>眉心輪完整指南：靛色第三眼開啟直覺洞察與內在智慧</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「&lt;strong&gt;第三眼&lt;/strong&gt;」是靈性圈最常被討論、也最容易被誤解的詞。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪守護水晶速查表：每個脈輪該配什麼石頭最有感</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶療癒這幾年很紅——但很多人買了一堆水晶，卻不知道&lt;strong&gt;哪個對應哪個脈輪&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;該怎麼搭配&lt;/strong&gt;。買到對的水晶，能感覺能量明顯改變；買到不對的或亂配，效果就只是「漂亮」。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>心輪完整指南：綠色愛之輪打開人際連結與自我慈悲</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果問你：「&lt;strong&gt;你愛自己嗎？&lt;/strong&gt;」——你的第一反應會是什麼？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>頂輪完整指南：紫色冠之輪連結宇宙意識與靈性圓滿</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;七大脈輪走到最後，到了頭頂——這是**頂輪（Sahasrara, Crown Chakra）**所在的位置，也是整套能量地圖的盡頭。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪完整入門：從海底輪到頂輪的能量地圖一次看懂</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「脈輪」這個詞，這幾年從瑜伽課堂、靈氣療癒到 IG 命理帳號到處都看得到。可是真的問起來：&lt;strong&gt;七個脈輪是哪七個？順序怎麼排？為什麼有對應顏色和水晶？要從哪一個開始練？&lt;/strong&gt;——能完整答得出來的人其實不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>海底輪完整指南：紅色根之輪如何打造安全感與接地能量</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果你曾經在凌晨三點醒來，胸口悶悶地，腦袋一片亂，又說不出到底在擔心什麼——那種「&lt;strong&gt;好像有什麼地方不安全&lt;/strong&gt;」的感覺，往往不是真的有事，而是你的**海底輪（Muladhara, Root Chakra）**正在跟你說話。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>喉輪完整指南：藍色表達之輪說出真實與創意之聲</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;你有沒有過這種經驗？心裡明明有滿滿的話想說，可是話到嘴邊就吞回去；或是會議上明明知道答案，卻在被點到那一刻喉嚨突然發乾、聲音變小、整個人縮了起來？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶 x 眉心輪 &amp; 頂輪：一顆石頭，同時打開兩個靈性能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大多數水晶只對應一個脈輪。紫水晶不一樣——它同時連結眉心輪和頂輪，也就是七脈輪體系裡最頂端的兩個能量中心。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>